{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meticulously crafted <strong>Metroidbrainia</strong> game. You find yourself lost in a vast maze filled with pools, where secrets lie beneath their calm and gentle surfaces. Various traps and mechanisms hinder your progress, and unknown entities instill fear in your heart. Search for specific items and leverage the behaviors of unknown creatures. You will unravel the puzzles, uncover your past, and ultimately make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by poolcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and Puzzles Throughout the Maze: </strong>A variety of items, each with different functions and methods of use. Multiple areas feature diverse themes and puzzles. Interact with items and rooms to solve puzzles and open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/4226b872988bf24c9310aaa0832f0b8d.poster.avif?t=1772144986\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/4226b872988bf24c9310aaa0832f0b8d.webm?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/4226b872988bf24c9310aaa0832f0b8d.mp4?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/6769b96f3359161e3868f34e98157f3a.poster.avif?t=1772144986\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/6769b96f3359161e3868f34e98157f3a.webm?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/6769b96f3359161e3868f34e98157f3a.mp4?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Excellent Platforming Mechanics: </strong>The maze is filled with various mechanisms and traps, and the precise platforming characteristics empower you to explore without fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/ddbb4715e8e8423e840055f035e26b69.poster.avif?t=1772144986\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/ddbb4715e8e8423e840055f035e26b69.webm?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/ddbb4715e8e8423e840055f035e26b69.mp4?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8bfee18bc89e394970515974c91a3bb6.poster.avif?t=1772144986\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8bfee18bc89e394970515974c91a3bb6.webm?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8bfee18bc89e394970515974c91a3bb6.mp4?t=1772144986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Entity Enemies: </strong>The maze is teeming with unknown entities; some are friendly, while others are dangerous. Understanding them, fleeing, or exploiting them is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto